---
import PhotoSlot from './PhotoSlot.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title" data-section="about">
  <div class="graticule meta"><span>about · hardware</span><span>san josé, ca</span></div>
  <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
  <div class="col">
    <p>
      I'm a student at San José State University. Before the software there were robots: I was president of the BattleBots
      club at De Anza, competed in FIRST Robotics, and collaborated with the UCSC Formula SAE team. My projects now sit
      where hardware meets learning systems: prosthetic control, neural decoders that have to run on-body, and tooling
      that notices when a model has quietly stopped working.
    </p>
